{
  "title": "AI Profiles, Personas and Templates: Build and Reuse Your Assistants | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "An AI assistant is more than a model: it needs instructions, a name and a voice, knowledge, tools and limits. The CrestApps AI module keeps all of that in a profile, lets you give assistants a reusable character with personas, and saves you from starting over with profile templates and reusable prompt templates.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why each assistant is described once and its parts are reused\n• How profiles, personas, profile templates and prompt templates fit together\n• Starting a profile from the New AI Profile picker\n• Every card and tab of the profile editor\n• Profile types, cloning, and the profile list\n• Creating a persona and choosing it in a profile\n• Creating a profile template and starting a profile from it\n• Reusable system prompt templates\n• Use cases: website assistants, standard assistants, shared characters, background work",
